    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddf0 Toolbox Tycoon \u2013 Build Your Trade Empire (BETA Testing)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Toolbox Tycoon</strong> is a fast-paced business management sim where you grow your own plumbing, HVAC, or electrical company from scratch. Hire staff, manage jobs, expand your fleet, and outmaneuver rival businesses in a dynamic city economy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're fixing AC units or juggling loan repayments, every decision counts. Start small, scale up smart, and dominate the trades.<br><br>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Key Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auto Job Assignment</strong> \u2013 Build your team and get more jobs across the line! Time is money.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic City Map</strong> \u2013 Watch jobs spawn across town and dispatch your team in real-time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hiring System</strong> \u2013 Recruit apprentices, tradespeople, and masters with unique costs and capabilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vehicle &amp; Tool Management</strong> \u2013 Balance speed, reach, and operating costs as your jobs scale.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Competitor AI</strong> \u2013 Competing companies operate on the same map. Expand or buy them out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reputation System</strong> \u2013 Better jobs and loan rates come with a stronger name. (Coming soon)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgradeable Headquarters</strong> \u2013 Unlock new systems and benefits as you level up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Trade Economy</strong> \u2013 Simulated cash flow, client demand, and growing complexity.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddf0 Toolbox Tycoon \u2013 Build Your Trade Empire (BETA Testing)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Toolbox Tycoon</strong> is a fast-paced business management sim where you grow your own plumbing, HVAC, or electrical company from scratch. Hire staff, manage jobs, expand your fleet, and outmaneuver rival businesses in a dynamic city economy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're fixing AC units or juggling loan repayments, every decision counts. Start small, scale up smart, and dominate the trades.<br><br>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Key Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auto Job Assignment</strong> \u2013 Build your team and get more jobs across the line! Time is money.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic City Map</strong> \u2013 Watch jobs spawn across town and dispatch your team in real-time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hiring System</strong> \u2013 Recruit apprentices, tradespeople, and masters with unique costs and capabilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vehicle &amp; Tool Management</strong> \u2013 Balance speed, reach, and operating costs as your jobs scale.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Competitor AI</strong> \u2013 Competing companies operate on the same map. Expand or buy them out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reputation System</strong> \u2013 Better jobs and loan rates come with a stronger name. (Coming soon)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgradeable Headquarters</strong> \u2013 Unlock new systems and benefits as you level up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Trade Economy</strong> \u2013 Simulated cash flow, client demand, and growing complexity.</p></li></ul>",
